      <VERS vnumber="17"> He casteth <gr str="7993">forth </gr>his <gr str="7140">ice </gr>like <gr str="6595">morsels</gr>: <gr str="4310">who </gr>can <gr str="5975">stand </gr>
        <gr str="6440">before </gr>his <gr str="7135">cold</gr>? </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="18"> He sendeth <gr str="7971">out </gr>his <gr str="1697">word</gr>, and <gr str="4529">melteth </gr>them: he causeth his <gr str="7307">wind </gr>to <gr str="5380">blow</gr>, <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> and </STYLE> the <gr str="4325">waters </gr>
        <gr str="5140">flow</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="19"> He <gr str="5046">showeth </gr>his <gr str="1697">word </gr>unto <gr str="3290">Jacob</gr>, his <gr str="2706">statutes </gr>and his <gr str="4941">judgments </gr>unto <gr str="3478">Israel</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="20"> He hath <gr str="3808">not </gr>
